[%- set repo_url = "https://github.com/" ~ github_repository -%]
[%- set repo_name = github_repository.split("/") | last -%]

# Contributing

Contributions follow the [Code of Conduct](CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md).

## Setup

```sh
git clone (( repo_url ))
cd (( repo_name ))
prek install
```

The hooks in [.pre-commit-config.yaml](.pre-commit-config.yaml) format and lint
every commit, and CI runs the same hooks.

## Commits

Messages follow [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/).
[%- if is_public %] The Commit Lint workflow checks each commit and the pull
request title.
[%- endif %]

## Releases

Pushing a `vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH` tag publishes a release with GitHub's generated
notes.
